    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThe Blood's Way\u201d is a short 2D action-adventure game driven by story, blending classical Chinese fantasy and mythology, and brought to life with a unique hand-drawn pixel art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those you face\u2014are they your kin, or your enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or would you rather stand against mythical beasts and celestial warriors from the Heavenly Court?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden secrets, expose the truth behind the conspiracy, and make choices that shape your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your resolve shatter the shackles of the heavens?</p>",
